er:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\">Agent Demo</a><a href=\"/#privacy-note\" class=\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\">Privacy &amp; Terms</a><a href=\"mailto:hello@digirobotics.xyz\" class=\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\">Contact Us</a></nav></div><div id=\"privacy-note\" class=\"mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-white/[.08] pt-6 text-[13px] leading-5 text-white/45 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\"><p>Privacy and terms notices will be published before campaign enrollment or data collection begins. Contact the team for Phase 1 information.</p><p>© 2026 DigiRobotics</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-white/45\"><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"r