 \",\"November 20, 2026\"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[170px_minmax(0,760px)] lg:justify-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden lg:block\",\"children\":\"$L5\"}],\"$L6\"]}]]}],\"$L7\"]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@9\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lb\",\"isPartial\":\"$@c\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L10\",\"isPartial\":\"$@11\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@12\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@13\"}\n26:I[38437,[\"99489\",\"static/chunks/99489-7b4b74c1a59849db.js\",\"5772\",\"static/chunks/5772-2ad3d6bb0136fa62.js\",\"57304\",\"static/chunks/57304-ca98254065b92130.js\",\"95953\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-a38ec015cb873e3f.js\"],\"Image\"]\n2b:I[90484,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n2c:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2e:I[90484,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n2f:I[90484,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n30:I[86869,[],\"IconMark\"]\n31:I[57121,[],\"\"]\n32:I[74581,[],\"\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-28 border-t border-[var(--primary)] pt-4 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase leading-5 tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"DigiRobotics\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"Field note\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"2026.11.20\"]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"blockquote\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-10 border-l-2 border-[var(--primary)] bg-[var(--primary)]/[0.06] px-6 py-2 font-heading text-xl leading-8 text-white sm:px-8\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"TL;DR:\"}]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Capturing a real environment once — a metric 3D scan plus first-person human demonstrations — can be repurposed endlessly into simulation environments, robot trajectories, and long-horizon training data. The bottleneck is not just capture; it is the cost of producing demonstrations at scale. Stablecoin micropayments have removed the fee floor: sub-cent and nanopayment settlement makes per-request data commerce economically viable. Combined, they point to a future where robots and agents buy verified physical-world data by the scan, the trajectory, or even the frame. DigiRobotics is building exactly this marketplace, converting capture into a supply chain.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Capture Once, Train Everywhere\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Real-robot data collection is brutally expensive. One widely cited robotics demonstration dataset required a small army of human operators working for a full year to produce a few hundred hours of robot-executed demonstrations — and a physical robot cannot simply retry a failed manipulation the way a simulator can.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"A newly released research collection proposes a different equation. Its recipe includes metric-scale 3D scans of real environments — over 1,500 real-world interior scenes captured at physical accuracy. It includes egocentric human recordings — 4,000+ first-person videos across 74 everyday tasks, with synchronized body and hand motion, totaling 130+ hours. And it includes one shared coordinate frame — every video, motion trace, and scan aligned so the data composes into a single coherent world model.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The breakthrough is reuse. Each capture is transformed multiple ways. Scenes become physically interactive simulation environments for closed-loop policy evaluation. Human motion is retargeted into whole-body robot trajectories — supervision without a robot on site. Virtual teleoperation and automated long-horizon trajectory generation multiply demonstrations from the same source capture.\\nThis is the emerging gold standard: joint capture of environments and behaviors as a single reusable asset — the raw material for establishing scaling laws for physical AI, mirroring how scaling laws transformed language models.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"The Economics of Physical AI Data\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Language models benefited from a data source that was essentially free: the open web. Physical AI has no equivalent. Every demonstration of a human folding laundry, wiring a panel, or restoring a shelf must be captured, aligned, annotated, and validated in the physical world.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L14\",\"\\n\",\"$L15\",\"\\n\",\"$L16\",\"\\n\",\"$L17\",\"\\n\",\"$L18\",\"\\n\",\"$L19\",\"\\n\",\"$L1a\",\"\\n\",\"$L1b\",\"\\n\",\"$L1c\",\"\\n\",\"$L1d\",\"\\n\",\"$L1e\",\"\\n\",\"$L1f\",\"\\n\",\"$L20\",\"\\n\",\"$L21\",\"\\n\",\"$L22\",\"\\n\",\"$L23\",\"\\n\",\"$L24\"],\"$L25\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/[.08] bg-[#111620] py-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"src\":\"/digirobotics/brand/digirobotics-logo.png\",\"alt\":\"DigiRobotics.xyz\",\"width\":210,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-auto w-[190px]\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-[17px] text-white/60\",\"children\":\"Egocentric data for robotics training.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Footer navigation\",\"className\":\"flex max-w-2xl flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contributor\",{\"href\":\"/#contributors\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contributor\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Marketplace\",{\"href\":\"/#marketplace\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Marketplace\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Custom Data\",{\"href\":\"/#custom-data\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Custom Data\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Capture Gear\",{\"href\":\"/gear\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Capture Gear\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Articles\",{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Agent Demo\",{\"href\":\"/agent-demo\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Agent Demo\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Privacy & Terms\",{\"href\":\"/#privacy-note\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Privacy & Terms\"}],\"$L27\"]}]]}],\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\"]}]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2c\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@2d\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2c\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"One Scan, Many Robots: Pay-Per-Frame Data — DigiRobotics\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"A new gold standard in physical AI research shows that capturing a real environment once can be repurposed endlessly into simulation environments, robot trajectories, and training data. Stablecoin micropayments remove the fee floor, making per-request data commerce viable.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.webmanifest\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/one-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"One Scan, Many Robots: Pay-Per-Frame Data\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"A new gold standard in physical AI research shows that capturing a real environment once can be repurposed endlessly into simulation environments, robot trajectories, and training data. Stablecoin micropayments remove the fee floor, making per-request data commerce viable.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/blog/one-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/one-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"One Scan, Many Robots: Pay-Per-Frame Data\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"article:modified_time\",\"content\":\"2026-11-20\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"DigiRobotics Team\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"One Scan, Many Robots: Pay-Per-Frame Data\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"A new gold standard in physical AI research shows that capturing a real environment once can be repurposed endlessly into simulation environments, robot trajectories, and training data. Stablecoin micropayments remove the fee floor, making per-request data commerce viable.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://digirobotics.xyz/images/blog/one-scan-many-robots-pay-per-frame-data-cover.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"17\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?63d5b2ef705d808e\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-icon.png?1f3d5ce59ec9c445\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"1254x1254\"}],[\"$\",\"$L30\",\"20\",{}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{}]}]]}]\n13:true\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"That imposes real costs at every layer. Capture hardware includes calibrated cameras, motion tracking, and scanning rigs. Contributor time means authentic, unstaged task performance across diverse environments. Alignment work means registering video, motion, and 3D geometry into one coordinate frame. Quality validation means filtering, consent, and governance before data is usable.\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The research insight cuts costs per capture by enabling reuse. But it does not change the underlying problem: the world's physical task diversity is enormous, and no single lab can scan and demonstrate all of it.\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Scaling physical AI therefore requires a distributed supply — thousands of capture sites and contributors, each producing reusable, verified environment-behavior bundles. What's missing is not capability. It's a mechanism to transact efficiently.\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Micropayments Remove the Fee Floor\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Traditional payment rails were never built for data commerce: a fixed ~$0.30 card fee makes a $0.10 purchase absurd — over 300% overhead. For decades, that fee floor is why the internet's predicted micropayment economy collapsed into advertising instead.\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Stablecoin settlement on low-cost networks has dismantled that floor. Sub-cent, even nanopayment settlement means transaction costs measured in milleths of a cent, with reported nanopayments as small as one millionth of a dollar. Seconds, not days means settlement in near-real time versus card networks' multi-day windows. No chargeback asymmetry means programmable, final, verifiable settlement suited to machine counterparties. Geography-flat pricing means the same cost whether buyer and seller are neighbors or hemispheres apart.\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The revived HTTP 402 payment pattern completes the loop: a server declares payment terms, a client pays programmatically with stablecoins, retries the request, and receives the protected resource — no account, no subscription, no API key. Streaming-payment protocols push it further, settling value continuously, per second.\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The clearest early demand is not humans buying articles. It is AI agents paying per request — for API calls, compute cycles, tool usage, and data access.\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"When Robots Buy the World's Experience\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Now connect the two halves. Physical AI needs an enormous, distributed supply of environments and behaviors. Micropayments make per-unit data commerce viable. The consequence is a market design that has never existed. Pay per scan means an embodied agent purchasing a metric 3D model of a restaurant kitchen it must operate in tomorrow. Pay per trajectory means retargeted whole-body demonstrations licensed individually, instead of negotiating for a full dataset. Pay per frame means nanopayment-sized exchanges for targeted egocentric clips and annotated events. Pay per environment rollout means buying simulation time in verified, scan-accurate interactive scenes for policy evaluation. Stream as it contributes means contributors earning continuously, per second of validated capture, through streaming settlement.\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"In this model, a robot that encounters an unfamiliar task does not stop to wait for a lab to collect data. It queries the marketplace, pays a fraction of a cent for verified first-person experience of that exact situation, learns, and proceeds. The physical world becomes a queryable, machine-payable experience supply.\"}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"How DigiRobotics Is Building the Future\"}]\n20:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"DigiRobotics is building the connective tissue for this market. It is creating a stablecoin-native marketplace for real-world robotics data — where physical AI environments and egocentric behaviors are listed, licensed, and settled at machine speed. Its reusable capture standards align 3D scans, first-person video, and motion data into shared coordinate frames so every capture trades as a multi-use asset. Its nanopayment-ready rails provide sub-cent, streaming, and pay-per-request settlement primitives purpose-built for agent-to-contributor data commerce. And its contributor economy with governance embeds consent, device verification, calibration, and quality validation into the collection workflow.\"}]\n21:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-14\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Physical AI scaled the web's way: through a marketplace where experience itself is the commodity.\"}]\n22:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-5\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Start Building With Us\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-15\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Whether you capture real-world task data, train embodied models, or deploy autonomous agents — the experience economy for machines is opening.\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-16\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Join DigiRobotics to contribute, license, or integrate — and help build the rails where robots pay for the world.\"}]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold transition hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":\"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon\",\"size\":16,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" Return to the archive\"]}]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contact Us\",{\"href\":\"mailto:hello@digirobotics.xyz\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contact Us\"}]\n28:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"privacy-note\",\"className\":\"mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-white/[.08] pt-6 text-[13px] leading-5 text-white/45 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Privacy and terms notices will be published before campaign enrollment or data collection begins. Contact the team for Phase 1 information.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"© 2026 DigiRobotics\"}]]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-white/45\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"x\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M18 6 6 18\",\"key\":\"1bl5f8\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m6 6 12 12\",\"key\":\"d8bk6v\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"mail\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\",\"key\":\"132q7q\"}],[\"rect\",{\"x\":\"2\",\"y\":\"4\",\"width\":\"20\",\"height\":\"16\",\"rx\":\"2\",\"key\":\"izxlao\"}]]},\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/35\",\"children\":\"Agent-compatible payment workflows powered by stablecoins and x402. Phase 1 infrastructure.\"}]\n2d:null\na:300\na:C\n12:0\nc:\"$undefined\"\ne:\"$undefined\"\n11:\"$undefined\"\n9:\"$undefined\"\n"}}